From: MyszkinPL <211237936+MyszkinPL@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: dt-bindings: audio-graph-port: allow TDM slot masks

audio-graph-card2 parses dai-tdm-slot-tx-mask/rx-mask on endpoints
(simple_util_parse_tdm -> snd_soc_of_parse_tdm_slot), the schema only
lists the slot number and width.

Signed-off-by: MyszkinPL <211237936+MyszkinPL@users.noreply.github.com>
---
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/audio-graph-port.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/audio-graph-port.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/audio-graph-port.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/audio-graph-port.yaml
@@ -88,6 +88,12 @@
       dai-tdm-slot-width:
         description: Width in bits for each slot.
         $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32
+      dai-tdm-slot-tx-mask:
+        description: Slots used for transmit (playback), one 0/1 cell per slot.
+        $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32-array
+      dai-tdm-slot-rx-mask:
+        description: Slots used for receive (capture), one 0/1 cell per slot.
+        $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32-array
       dai-tdm-slot-width-map:
         description: Mapping of sample widths to slot widths. For hardware
           that cannot support a fixed slot width or a slot width always

